{"id":"2005806657599451235","kind":"article","title":"将心智模型付诸实践的框架","author":"Cedric Chin","original_authors":["Cedric Chin"],"original_source_urls":["https://commoncog.com/a-framework-for-putting-mental-models-to-practice/"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"隐性知识 & 专业技能","date":"2026-03-28","updated":"2026-03-28","votes":37,"comment_count":2,"minutes":1,"chars":526,"keywords":["心智模型","决策科学","理性思维","实践认识论","决策能力"],"summary":"这则系列导读说明，作者希望以理性研究、决策科学、应用心理学和认识论为基础，整理如何把心智模型用于日常决策的实践框架，并列出后续文章目录。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005806657599451235","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"sOWJlmas\"><b>《将心智模型付诸实践的框架》</b>是一个系列文集，旨在探讨如何在生活中真正地运用「<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://fs.blog/mental-models/?ref=commoncog.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">心智模型</a>」，以求习得更卓越的决策能力。</p><p data-pid=\"ry_ZUPE-\">本系列所呈现的观点，是对理性研究、决策科学、应用心理学及古典认识论的一次深入导览。我开发此框架的初衷，是为自己追求个人目标时，能有一个用于提升决策与判断能力的理论架构。</p><p data-pid=\"PZg1tVuw\">本系列最初为 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://fs.blog/membership/?ref=commoncog.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Farnam Street 学习社区</a>撰写并发表，同时也是对我此前在《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/the-mental-model-fallacy/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">心智模型的谬误</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>》一文中所提批评的一份建设性回应。</p><p data-pid=\"vOUugYw9\">若您时间有限或暂无兴趣阅读全文，可参阅简短的摘要文章：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/the-mental-model-faq/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">心智模型常见问题解答</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><ol><li data-pid=\"wNTumezH\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/a-framework-for-putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">芒格的演讲</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"4BFD6Fdy\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-2-introduction-to-rationality/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">理性思维入门</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"Ty0-8HJ6\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-3-better-trial-and-error/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">更好的试错法</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"-sLgV8iE\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">专家的决策之道</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"L47rIPHq\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-5-skill-extraction/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萃取专家技能</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"aSFKc_dD\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/putting-mental-models-to-practice-part-6-a-personal-epistemology-of-practice/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">构建个人的实践认识论</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup></li></ol><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"4M74ZBPv\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-3.1-pro-preview，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>作者：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/author/cedric/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cedric Chin</a><br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://commoncog.com/a-framework-for-putting-mental-models-to-practice/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A Framework for Putting Mental Models to Practice - Commoncog</a>、<br/>最初发布于 2018 年 12 月 25 日，最后更新于 2023 年 6 月 13 日</blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回